OL,3,GNEWSADaniel Thomas admits boat criminal
OL,4,Adamage in channel
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-migrant activist Daniel Thomas,
OL,7,Falso known as Danny Tommo, has admitted
OL,8,Fcriminal damage after slashing a dinghy
OL,9,Fwith a knife in the English Channel.
OL,11,FThe 37-year-old changed his plea to the
OL,12,Fsingle charge when he appeared via
OL,13,Fvideo link from prison at Portsmouth
OL,14,FCrown Court on Thursday.
OL,16,FA court previously heard he had taken a
OL,17,Fboat into the English Channel on 22
OL,18,FSeptember and observed the migrant
OL,19,Foccupants of a dinghy being assisted by
OL,20,Fthe RNLI, Border Force and the French
OL,21,FCoastguard.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
